  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Iran accuses US of ‘war crime’ after missile blast kills four people at wedding",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/02/iran-us-missile-blast-wedding",
      "description": "<p>Blast also injures 68 guests at the wedding in southern Iran, prompting fears of escalation in hostilities</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/sep/02/iran-us-middle-east-war-strikes-tehran-washington-wedding-trump-kuwait-jordan-latest-news-updates\">Middle East crisis live – latest updates</a></p></li></ul><p>Iran has accused the US of a war crime after a missile blast killed at least four people and injured 68 who were attending a wedding at a private home in a coastal city of southern Iran, as the fresh exchange of strikes <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/01/us-iran-airstrikes-launch\">prompted fears of a wider renewal of hostilities.</a></p><p>Iranian media said that the wedding ceremony was being held in a home in the city of Kuhestak, Hormozgan province, late on Tuesday when a US missile struck, with shrapnel and debris from the strike killing and injuring people.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/02/iran-us-missile-blast-wedding\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-02T15:19:04"
    },
    {
      "title": "US and Iran exchange more airstrikes, fuelling fears of wider return to hostilities",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/01/us-iran-airstrikes-launch",
      "description": "<p>Attacks on Iran’s Revolutionary Guard and reprisals against US bases in Middle East quash hopes that flare-up last weekend was limited in nature</p><p>The US has launched new airstrikes on Iranian targets, prompting counter strikes by Tehran targeting American interests in Bahrain, Kuwait, Jordan and Iraq, fuelling concerns about a ⁠wider renewal of hostilities.</p><p>US Marine Corps base Camp Titin in Jordan was targeted for an “intense ballistic missile attack”, Iran’s Revolutionary Guards (IRGC) said early on Wednesday, according to Iranian news outlet Tasnim.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/01/us-iran-airstrikes-launch\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-02T01:06:08"
    }
